# The DY voices always (0.17.75): the Settings page's second knob was Voices (DX or DY); it is free now, and turning it leaves the human-made set on.
# The pluck on a DX voice plays on, and the Pluck page names it with its DX name.
seed 0
wait 500
setpar 98 80
setpar 99 12
wait 1000
expect dyvoices 1
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 2
wait 100
expect fxpage 18
spin K2 -1
wait 100
expect dyvoices 1
spin K2 1
wait 100
expect dyvoices 1
peakreset
wait 4000
expect peak_db_min -40
shot dyvoices.png
# the Pluck page: its Sound reads the DX name (the ARP cycle from the settings page)
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 17
shot dyvoices_pluck.png
